WEBVTT

00:00.952 --> 00:05.000
Shomoshsha number 1: t shomoye xy-shomantorole gotidayok
ekti kona

00:05.000 --> 00:09.800
(x(t), y((t)) obosthit, jekhane x(t) ebong y(t)

00:09.800 --> 00:11.502
spostobhabe deoya nai.

00:11.764 --> 00:14.141
Jokhon t 0er theke boro othoba shoman, tokhon

00:14.141 --> 00:17.390
x-er shonge t-er shomporker amoulik holo 4t+1

00:17.667 --> 00:21.797
y-er shonge t-er shomporker amoulik holo sin (t^2)

00:21.797 --> 00:26.240
ebong shomoy t=0 te x(0)=0 ebong y(0)=4.

00:26.378 --> 00:28.800
Besh, tobe cholun A ongshoti kori.

00:28.800 --> 00:33.610
t=3 shomoye konatir drutota ber korun,

00:33.825 --> 00:37.067
ebong

00:37.067 --> 00:40.533
t=3 shomoye konatir toron vector-o ber korun.

00:40.533 --> 00:45.333
Tai, goti ashole beg vectorer matra matro.

00:45.333 --> 00:47.137
to beg vector ki?

00:47.137 --> 00:50.979
Amader beg vector shomoyer function hishebe

00:50.979 --> 00:55.890
x-positioner amouliker shoman hote jachche

00:55.890 --> 00:59.467
shomoyer function hishebe, othtoba amra bolte pari je x-obhimukhi beg

00:59.467 --> 01:06.887
i unit vectorer shathe goon hoy, aro bolte pari je y-obhimukhi beg j unit vectorer shathey goon hoy.

01:06.887 --> 01:08.383
Ami eta shudhu prokoushol onkopaton-a likhlam,

01:08.383 --> 01:12.307
oboshshoi ekti vector nirnoyer bohu upaey ache.

01:12.307 --> 01:15.800
Ebong, ei khetre, x'(t), tara amader itimoddhei diye diyeche je:

01:15.800 --> 01:18.000
x'(t) hochche 4t+1

01:18.000 --> 01:20.333
tara shudhu etake dx/dt hishebe likhechen.

01:20.333 --> 01:27.005
Tai eta ekhane je 4t+1 i unit vectorer shathe goon hoy,

01:27.005 --> 01:31.467
ebong, tarpor eta ekhane, ei y'(t), tara amader diye diyeche

01:31.467 --> 01:33.933
t-er shathe shomporke y er amoulik hochche sin(t^2)

01:33.933 --> 01:41.800
Tai, aro sin((t^2) j unit vectorer shathe goon hoy.

01:41.800 --> 01:46.502
Otai hochche amader beg vector. Tahole amader beg koto-

01:46.502 --> 01:49.134
othoba eta shomoyer function hishebe amader beg vector.

01:49.134 --> 01:53.185
tahole t=3 shomoye amder beg koto?

01:53.400 --> 02:01.000
Tahole, amader t-er maan 3 hishebe anukalpo korte hobe, jate 4(3)+1 shoman 13i
